# Backend configuration now lives beside its application:
# Copy backend/.env.example to backend/.env.
# This root file is retained only to prevent use of the obsolete PKR/Astra settings.
# M3 uses Vite proxies for /api and /static; no frontend API key or URL is needed.
# M4 provider settings (SEARCH_*) live ONLY in backend/.env.example.
# Provider-free demo/keyword mode is the default.

